# Tic-Tac-Toe Game Features 🎮

## Core Game Features ✨

### 1. **Two-Player Gameplay**
- Play with a friend on the same device
- Alternating turns between Player X and Player O
- Perfect for parties and family game nights

### 2. **Beautiful User Interface**
- Modern gradient design (purple to blue)
- Smooth animations and transitions
- Clean, minimalist layout
- Professional looking game board

### 3. **Visual Feedback**
- **Hover effects** - Cells glow when mouse hovers
- **Click animations** - Smooth pop effect when placing marks
- **Color coding** - X in blue, O in purple
- **Winning highlight** - Winning line lights up in green gradient

### 4. **Smart Game Detection**
- **Automatic win detection** - Instantly recognizes all 8 winning combinations
- **Draw detection** - Knows when board is full with no winner
- **Real-time status updates** - Shows current player and game state

### 5. **Turn Management**
- **Turn indicator** - Large badge showing current player
- **Prevents invalid moves** - Can't overwrite occupied cells
- **Automatic player switching** - Alternates between X and O

### 6. **Game Controls**
- **New Game button** - Reset and play again anytime
- **Game status display** - Shows "X's turn", "O wins!", or "Draw!"

### 7. **Responsive Design**
- Works on all screen sizes
- Adapts to desktop, tablet, and mobile
- Maintains playability on different devices

### 8. **Accessibility**
- Clear visual indicators
- High contrast colors
- Easy to read text
- Simple, intuitive interface

## Technical Features 💻

### 9. **Pure Web Technologies**
- No dependencies or installations needed
- Runs in any modern browser
- Single HTML file - easy to share
- Lightweight and fast

### 10. **Robust Game Logic**
- **Board validation** - Prevents cheating
- **Move tracking** - Counts moves for draw detection
- **State management** - Tracks game active/inactive
- **Clean reset** - Full board reset with one click

### 11. **Visual Polish**
- Rounded corners on all elements
- Box shadows for depth
- Gradient backgrounds
- Smooth color transitions
- Scale effects on interaction

### 12. **User Experience**
- Instant feedback on clicks
- Clear win/loss/draw announcements
- Easy to understand interface
- No learning curve - intuitive gameplay

